  "description": "IQEMUQ crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C71 H64 B3 La3 O8,1.5(C4 H10 O2). From the CIF bond table, La1 (La) has 3 O neighbors; La2 (La) has 6 O neighbors; La2' (La) has 6 O neighbors; La3 (La) has 3 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 0.946-4.108 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 20.99-113.02°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C77H79B3La3O11.",
